      "status": "affected",
      "action_statement": "Update sqlite3 to 3.46.1-7+deb13u2+dhi1 or later.",
      "status_notes": "CVE-2026-11822 is an out-of-bounds read in fts5LeafSeek() in the SQLite FTS5 extension, fixed upstream in SQLite 3.53.2. Debian fixed it for trixie in sqlite3 3.46.1-7+deb13u2, which backports the upstream fix: https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-11822. This owner's first build based on 3.46.1-7+deb13u2 is the fixed version, and its package changelog records the Debian security update for CVE-2026-11822. Earlier builds based on 3.46.1-7+deb13u1 do not carry the fix."
    },
